Windows port (this tree: slate-windows/)

This directory is a derivative work of Slate v0.3.2
(https://github.com/wassermanproductions/slate), for personal use.

Modifications for the Windows port:
  - Electron main/preload host replaced with a Go + Wails v2 host
  - Packaging targets Windows (single binary via Wails) instead of macOS .app
  - Local image loading via host FileAsDataURL (WebView2) instead of file://
  - Circle Take stills discovery also probes %APPDATA%\circle-take when present
  - CLI brain discovery uses Windows PATH / common npm install locations
  - MCP control descriptor path uses %APPDATA%\slate\control.json (already
    supported by upstream on win32)

Original UI concepts, product design, prompt/compile logic, knowledge bases
(data/*.json), and overall application intent remain those of Sam Wasserman.

Attribution required in About / credits surfaces (retained).
